The files in this directory are redistributed unmodified from the npm package
@mediapipe/tasks-vision:

  vision_bundle.js                     minified bundle, classic-script build
  vision_bundle.mjs                    minified bundle, ES-module build
  wasm/vision_wasm_internal.*          SIMD runtime — the one the app loads
  wasm/vision_wasm_nosimd_internal.*   non-SIMD fallback runtime

Not everything upstream ships is kept. `vision_wasm_module_internal.*`, the
module-worker runtime, is deliberately not vendored: this app's tracker is a
classic worker, so no code path can select that build. Nothing else has been
added, removed or altered — see "Vendored assets" in the README.

The bundles are minified and carry no license header of their own, which is why
this notice exists alongside them.
